OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 10 JAN
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0900FRadio 3's American Roadtrip
OL,9,     GIn the second leg of Radio 3's
OL,10,     Gjourney across America, Petroc
OL,11,     GTrelawny visits Philadelphia to
OL,12,     Gexplore the stars and places
OL,13,     Gshaping Philly's vibrant
OL,14,     Gclassical musical life today.
OL,15,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,16,     GJools is joined by Stewart
OL,17,     GCopeland, drummer, composer and
OL,18,     Gfounder of The Police, with music
OL,19,     Gby Adams, Debussy and Liszt.
